---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How GearCompared makes money — full transparency">
  <main class="content">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.85rem;margin-bottom:24px;">Last updated: May 17, 2026</p>

    <h2>How We Make Money</h2>
    <p>GearCompared participates in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program. When you click a product link and make a purchase on Amazon, we may earn a small commission — at <strong>no additional cost to you</strong>. The price is exactly the same whether you use our link or go directly to Amazon.</p>

    <h2>Our Commitment to Objectivity</h2>
    <p>We do not accept free products, sponsorships, or paid placements. Our rankings are based on:</p>
    <ul style="margin-left:20px;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--text-secondary);">
      <li><strong>Objective specs</strong>: measurable data that can be verified</li>
      <li><strong>Aggregated user reviews</strong>: ratings and review counts from Amazon and other retailers</li>
      <li><strong>Value scoring</strong>: a composite score weighing performance against price</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Commission rates do not influence our rankings. Amazon pays the same percentage regardless of which product you buy.</p>

    <h2>What We Don't Do</h2>
    <ul style="margin-left:20px;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--text-secondary);">
      <li>We don't write fake reviews or fabricate opinions about products we've never tested</li>
      <li>We don't accept payment from brands to rank their products higher</li>
      <li>We don't use manipulative design to trick you into clicking affiliate links</li>
      <li>We don't hide our affiliate relationship — every page with links includes a disclosure</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Questions? hello@gearcompared.com</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
